    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a fun and surprising cat racing and breeding game! Here, you will experience a creative and joyful world of cats. In this exciting adventure, you can:<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257590/extras/b70b87f0a4cbd9a49b22c008550b572f.poster.avif?t=1735470555\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257590/extras/b70b87f0a4cbd9a49b22c008550b572f.webm?t=1735470555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257590/extras/b70b87f0a4cbd9a49b22c008550b572f.mp4?t=1735470555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore over 10 unique racing modes:</strong> Are you ready for the challenge? Experience different gameplay and competitive fun with modes like &quot;Greedy Snake Cat,&quot; &quot;Drunk Driving Check Challenge,&quot; &quot;Dracula Meow,&quot; &quot;Roller Coaster Subway,&quot; and other innovative tracks. Each mode has its own unique rules and strategies, ensuring a fresh experience in every race.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257590/extras/02d45603d87b11fc20ebcbb2711eb582.poster.avif?t=1735470555\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257590/extras/02d45603d87b11fc20ebcbb2711eb582.webm?t=1735470555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257590/extras/02d45603d87b11fc20ebcbb2711eb582.mp4?t=1735470555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257590/extras/f53bba2618ccc95f23a2f862b253a0e9.poster.avif?t=1735470555\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257590/extras/f53bba2618ccc95f23a2f862b253a0e9.webm?t=1735470555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257590/extras/f53bba2618ccc95f23a2f862b253a0e9.mp4?t=1735470555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breeding system and superpowers:</strong> Unlock your cat's quirky superpowers through a unique breeding system! Imagine a cat with a &quot;Helicopter Tail&quot; effortlessly soaring over obstacles, or other special skills that make your cat stand out in races. Combine different abilities to create one-of-a-kind cats and showcase your creativity.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257590/extras/695e697fb2dd23270f9a1de7423c736f.poster.avif?t=1735470555\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257590/extras/695e697fb2dd23270f9a1de7423c736f.webm?t=1735470555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257590/extras/695e697fb2dd23270f9a1de7423c736f.mp4?t=1735470555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257590/extras/50be24384df4775ba1073a9c471685e6.poster.avif?t=1735470555\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257590/extras/50be24384df4775ba1073a9c471685e6.webm?t=1735470555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257590/extras/50be24384df4775ba1073a9c471685e6.mp4?t=1735470555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compete against your friends' cats:</strong> Invite your friends to join the races and see whose cat is superior! While competing, you can also use various humorous items to prank your opponents' cats, adding even more laughter and fun.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257590/extras/6313e33786e37a2b6b425c715126badc.poster.avif?t=1735470555\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257590/extras/6313e33786e37a2b6b425c715126badc.webm?t=1735470555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257590/extras/6313e33786e37a2b6b425c715126badc.mp4?t=1735470555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Digitize your real-life cat:</strong> Transform your beloved real cat into a digital avatar in the game, complete with its unique appearance and personality. You can customize outfits and accessories to make them shine in the game and fully express their individuality.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257590/extras/71fb3d2fe51eaab97a08aaa10486d035.poster.avif?t=1735470555\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257590/extras/71fb3d2fe51eaab97a08aaa10486d035.webm?t=1735470555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257590/extras/71fb3d2fe51eaab97a08aaa10486d035.mp4?t=1735470555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you are a racing game enthusiast or a passionate cat lover, this game will bring you endless joy and challenges! Join us and embark on your own cat adventure!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a fun and surprising cat racing and breeding game! Here, you will experience a creative and joyful world of cats. In this exciting adventure, you can:<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257590/extras/b70b87f0a4cbd9a49b22c008550b572f.poster.avif?t=1735470555\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257590/extras/b70b87f0a4cbd9a49b22c008550b572f.webm?t=1735470555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257590/extras/b70b87f0a4cbd9a49b22c008550b572f.mp4?t=1735470555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore over 10 unique racing modes:</strong> Are you ready for the challenge? Experience different gameplay and competitive fun with modes like &quot;Greedy Snake Cat,&quot; &quot;Drunk Driving Check Challenge,&quot; &quot;Dracula Meow,&quot; &quot;Roller Coaster Subway,&quot; and other innovative tracks. Each mode has its own unique rules and strategies, ensuring a fresh experience in every race.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257590/extras/02d45603d87b11fc20ebcbb2711eb582.poster.avif?t=1735470555\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257590/extras/02d45603d87b11fc20ebcbb2711eb582.webm?t=1735470555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257590/extras/02d45603d87b11fc20ebcbb2711eb582.mp4?t=1735470555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline post